<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTALW OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTALW OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.35 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.60 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.51 vs   0.52</p>
<p> Sales		    9.63 vs  11.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.55 vs   2.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.44 vs   3.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.68 vs   3.02</p>
<p> Sales		   73.89 vs   65x79</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Mostostal</p>
<p>Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
